{"hw":"ἀντιγραφή","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀντιγραφή</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀντιγραφ-ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">a reply in writing,</b> such as Caesar's <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Anticato</cite> in reply to Cicero's <b class=\"lex-tr\">Cato,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Caes.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span>,cf.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sol.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1059b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Herm.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.189A.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> as law-term, <b class=\"lex-tr\">answer put in by the defendant, plea,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">45.46</span> </span> (where a specimen is found); sts. of <b class=\"lex-tr\">the plaintiff's plea, indictment,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">27c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hyp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eux.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31</span> </span>:—sts. <span class=\"gk\">ἀντιγραφή</span> was used indifferently of both parties, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Harp.</span> </span>:—in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">471</span> </span>, generally, <b class=\"lex-tr\">counter-pleas,</b> cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Poll.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.58</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">transcribing,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.H.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.62</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> = ἀντίγραφον, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.577e</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">IV</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">rescript, imperial decree</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OGI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">262.27</span> </span>.</div></div>"}